{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32913","headline":"奉陪裴相公重阳日游安乐池亭 · 李郢","name":"奉陪裴相公重阳日游安乐池亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绦霄轻霭翊三台，稽阮襟怀管乐才。\n莲沼昔爲王俭府，菊篱今作孟嘉杯。\n宁知北阙元勳在，却引东山旧客来。\n自笑吐茵还酩酊，日斜空从绦衣回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32913.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32913","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}